# pop'n music 9, a second card added to a KONAMI ID, with --autoplay. After
# popn9-konamiid-new.his (same --nvram), with DIR/card.bin deleted, so the reader holds a fresh
# card: it is registered as in popn9-card-new.his (name, PIN 1234 twice; numbering gives
# 2003010000000028), a credit is played by the game, and at its end カードへ登録 (blue 4 once):
# the ID "hiraku09", the password 5678 once -> userid.addcard user="hiraku09" pass="5678"
# card="2003010000000028", and "ポップンミュージックカードの登録が完了しました！". The server's users
# file then lists both cards for hiraku09.
#   hiraku-popn9 --autoplay --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-konamiid-addcard.his
game popn9
watch mode u32 0x25a0d8
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5500 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5560 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5620 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 9150 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 9180 press "Keypad 2" 8
